OL,3,AbA Scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,4,A'unprecedented' but no sign of
OL,5,Abreaches, says expert
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,8,Faffecting millions of websites is
OL,9,F"unprecedented", a boss at the UK's
OL,10,FNational Cyber Security Centre says,
OL,11,Fbut there is no sign of breaches so far
OL,13,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,14,Fprogramming language, which collects
OL,15,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,16,Fa way you can read on the web. Here's a
OL,17,Ftimeline of how the saga unfolded
OL,19,FMajor providers have implemented a fix,
OL,20,Fbut globally 90% of systems at risk are
OL,21,Fyet to do so, researchers say. Take a
OL,22,Flook at the flaw's effect worldwide
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
